			"Message": "chore(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates across 11 components\n\nSynchronize Air, Cocoon, Common, Echo, Grove, Mist, Mountain, Rest, SideCar, Sky, and Wind submodules with the following changes:\n\n**Features:**\n- Mountain: Implement tier-gating system with compile-time feature flags (Plan A §Rust) and runtime diagnostics. Add native file watcher (TierFileWatcherLayer4) backed by notify crate with debouncing and glob→regex filtering, forwarding events to Cocoon as `$fileWatcher:event` notifications. Implement workspace folder management with CLI parsing and Tauri commands. Complete stubbed IPC handlers (Terminal.Resize, Clipboard.Read/Write, NativeHost.OpenExternal, Tree operations, Task.Fetch/Execute, Authentication, Languages.GetAll, Debug.Stop, showOpenDialog). Add DevLog file sink for debug builds.\n- Common: Add FileWatcherProvider trait with RegisterWatcher/UnregisterWatcher methods. Add StopDebugging to DebugService, ResizeTerminal to TerminalProvider.\n- Wind: Bridge VS Code dialog channels to Tauri's native dialog plugin for \"File → Open Folder\" functionality. Add Tier.ts for tier feature-gating mirror.\n- Sky: Inject Tier* environment variables into import.meta.env via Vite define config.\n\n**Dependency Updates:**\n- Common: Bump pnpm/action-setup 5.0.0 → 6.0.0\n- Echo: Bump actions/upload-artifact 7.0.0 → 7.0.1\n- Sky: Bump ad-m/github-push-action 1.0.0 → 1.1.0, actions/upload-artifact 7.0.0 → 7.0.1\n\n**Documentation:**\n- Air, Echo, Grove, Mist, Rest, SideCar: Update Documentation/Rust submodule to latest",
